# Accepted performance baseline: written by `SC_PERF_RECORD=1 ci/perf_gate.sh`, compared by ci/perf_gate.sh.
# In-process constants: 100 serial self-transpile rounds (CPU ms, on-core Mcyc, Kalloc = allocator calls in
# thousands); BUILD constants: one cold dev build of the compiler through the engine with every core.
